> Sokoban:
> 1) What am I guaranteed to get in Sokoban, as far as items?

In the end level of Sokoban you'll get the prize which is either a bag of
holding or an amulet of reflection.
Apart from that, on each of the four levels you'll find 1 guaranteed wand
and 1 guaranteed ring, and lots of food.

> 2) Are items in Sokoban ever cursed?  Food doesn't ever seem to be
> cursed there.

I believe they have the normal probabilities for buc-status, the same as
they would have if you found them in the normal dungeons.
Now food is never cursed (or blessed for that matter) unless you find it in
a bones file. There may be an exception to this rule, though, I'm not sure.
It may be that you got the impression that only in Sokoban food is never
cursed because you can't leave (and thus, load) bones there.

